- Added getQRCode() to TablesService — generates data URL via qrcode lib, uses CUSTOMER_WEB_URL env var
- Added GET /tables/:id/qr to TablesController (JWT-guarded)
- Added CUSTOMER_WEB_URL=http://192.168.0.109:3003 to apps/api/.env
- Admin tables page: QrCode button on each card → QRModal with image, download, and print (DOM-safe, no document.write)

## Feature 2: Settings — Security tab (Password Change)
